o complete them.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Threatspec", "url": "https://threatspec.org/", "desc": "Threatspec is an open source project that aims to close the gap between development and security by bringing the threat modelling process further into the development process.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "PyTM", "url": "https://github.com/izar/pytm", "desc": "PyTM is an open source project providing a library for threat modeling with code. Describe your system using OO syntax (object.property = value) and have your threat modeling report automatically generated. 100+ threats currently supported.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "MAL", "url": "https://mal-lang.org", "desc": "MAL is an open source project that supports creation of cyber threat modeling systems and attack simulations.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Threagile", "url": "https://github.com/Threagile/threagile", "desc": "Threagile is an open-source toolkit for agile threat modeling", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "TicTaaC", "url": "https://github.com/rusakovichma/TicTaaC", "desc": "Threat modeling-as-a-Code in a Tick (TicTaaC). Lightweight and easy-to-use Threat modeling solution following DevSecOps principles", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Threat Modeling Online Game", "url": "https://github.com/dehydr8/elevation-of-privilege", "desc": "Online version of the Elevation of Privilege and Cornucopia card games. The easy way to get started with threat modeling.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Deciduous", "url": "https://github.com/rpetrich/deciduous", "desc": "A web app that simplifies building attack decision trees. Hosted at https://www.deciduous.app/", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "drawio-threatmodeling", "url": "https://github.com/michenriksen/drawio-threatmodeling", "desc": "A collection of custom libraries to turn the free and cross-platform Draw.io diagramming application into the perfect tool for threat modeling.", "section": "Free tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Irius risk", "url": "https://iriusrisk.com/threat-modeling-tool/", "desc": "Iriusrisk is a threat modeling tool with an adaptive questionnaire driven by an expert system which guides the user through straight forward questions about the technical architecture, the planned features and security context of the application.", "section": "Paid tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "SD elements", "url": "https://www.securitycompass.com/sdelements/threat-modeling/", "desc": "Automate Threat Modeling with SD Elements.", "section": "Paid tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Foreseeti", "url": "https://www.foreseeti.com/", "desc": "SecuriCAD Vanguard is an attack simulation and automated threat modeling SaaS service that enables you to automatically simulate attacks on a virtual model of your AWS environment.", "section": "Paid tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "Tutamen Threat Model system", "url": "https://www.tutamantic.com", "desc": "This tool allows threat model metadata to be added to any software diagram, turning that diagram into a threat model. It's simple to use, requires no lock-in license, and is driven by the Common Weakness Enumeration, STRIDE and OWASP Top 10.", "section": "Paid tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}, {"name": "YAKINDU Security Analyst", "url": "https://www.itemis.com/de/yakindu/security-analyst/", "desc": "YAKINDU Security Analyst is a model-based software tool for threat analysis and risk assessment of technical systems. You can identify your protection needs, analyze possible threats and calculate the resulting risks. The underlying assessment model and calculation logic are highly customizable and can be integrated into existing toolchains.", "section": "Paid tools", "repo": "hysnsec/awesome-threat-modelling"}]}